Meta.DisplayName=Gatekeeper AMP Discord Bot
Meta.Description=Discord bot for controlling and monitoring AMP instances from Discord (start/stop/status, console relay, whitelist, permissions). Fork of k8thekat/GatekeeperV2, packaged by Comsicare. Requires a Discord Application/Bot token and an AMP user with Super Admins role.
